1
00:01:58,079 --> 00:02:00,799
We can see over a dozen police officers

2
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:03,200
charging in armed with heavy weapons.

3
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:05,239
We believe these criminals

4
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:06,959
will definitely be rounded up.

5
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:23,360
Currently, both robbers

6
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,560
have been apprehended by our officers.

7
00:02:25,919 --> 00:02:28,159
In today's police operation,

8
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:30,560
we not only rounded up all the criminals,

9
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:39,159
but also ensured the safety of the citizens present.

10
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,680
Throughout the entire incident,

11
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:43,479
not a single citizen was harmed.

12
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,039
I've never seen an operation this crazy.

13
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,240
You think your guy is Iron Man?

14
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:02,360
He's even tougher than Iron Man.

15
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,199
Next.

16
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,479
What's your name?

17
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,520
Zhuang Cen.

18
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,000
You're that Chinese guy.

19
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:28,719
Yes.

20
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:33,639
Impressive. Daring to steal from the Four Families.

21
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,080
What's your name?

22
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,279
My husband is a law-abiding citizen.

23
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,279
He can't be a robber.

24
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,519
Release him immediately!

25
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,720
Your husband was

26
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,759
robbing a drug shipment at gunpoint

27
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:27,160
when he was caught red-handed.

28
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,920
There's no way he's a robber!

29
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,360
I need to see him right now.

30
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,959
He committed a severe felony.

31
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,680
No one is allowed to see him right now.

32
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,959
We are Chinese citizens.

33
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,319
I know my rights.

34
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,920
If you insist on keeping me from him,

35
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,519
I will call the Chinese Consulate right now.

36
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,800
This is Country M,

37
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:42,480
not your home country.

38
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:44,240
I told you, I must see him now!

39
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,639
Let me tell you one more time.

40
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,439
Your husband committed a major felony.

41
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,680
Not only do we have the right to detain him,

42
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,199
we can also investigate anyone connected to him.

43
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,199
If you keep interfering with my work,

44
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,279
I will suspect that you

45
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:56,759
were involved in your husband's crime.

46
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,120
I'm giving you one chance.

47
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,560
If you don't leave right now,

48
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,800
I will arrest you.

49
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:02,920
You'll regret this.

50
00:05:09,879 --> 00:05:12,240
I didn't expect those guys to move early.

51
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,519
Good thing Zhuang Yan is okay.

52
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:17,519
Everything is still under our control.

53
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:21,560
Are you sure everything is under control?

54
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:25,160
Zhuang Yan is risking his life right now.

55
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:27,439
I don't even have a chance to meet him.

56
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:29,000
How are we supposed to launch the next move?

57
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:34,199
I'll find a way for you two to meet in a couple of days.

58
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,759
Your visit to the police station today was part of the act.

59
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,240
Once Zhuang Yan gets close to Ma Jingrong,

60
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,839
meeting him will actually make sense.

61
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:41,560
Since this is an undercover operation,

62
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,319
and a joint effort with Country M's police,

63
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,279
why make Zhuang Yan take

64
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,399
such a massive risk all by himself?

65
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,680
Piyazi and Thirade

66
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,879
definitely have moles inside the police.

67
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,279
We have to make the act look real.

68
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,720
That's the only way to fool their informants.

69
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,399
Zhuang Yan and I have an agreement.

70
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:55,600
One week.

71
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,319
Within one week,

72
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,800
if he can't get close to Ma Jingrong,

73
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,720
I'll request to call off this mission

74
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:02,240
and pull him out through official channels.

75
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:03,600
One week.

76
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,079
Yes.

77
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,360
Are you sure that within a week,

78
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,800
he won't be in any danger in there?

79
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:13,240
The drug ring we busted earlier...

80
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,759
...was led by Zhao Jianfeng.

81
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,439
Based on his confession

82
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:19,680
and the evidence collected at the scene,

83
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,480
we can now confirm that

84
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:22,439
his direct supplier

85
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,319
is Zhang Xuebin, founder of Chaoqing Online Shop.

86
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,160
Chaoqing Online Shop and Yike Gifts

87
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,639
have always been under our suspicion.

88
00:07:30,319 --> 00:07:32,399
Their managers are likely just like Qian Feng,

89
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:35,519
all acting under Chen Hai's orders.

90
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,120
However, our suspicion of Chen Hai

91
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,600
is currently merely a deduction.

92
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:41,720
We lack solid evidence to back it up,

93
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:44,279
so we can't arrest Chen Hai just yet.

94
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:46,560
Arrest the heads of Chaoqing Online Shop

95
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,759
and Yike Gifts,

96
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:49,000
Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying,

97
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,600
to see if we can obtain

98
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,839
any evidence linking Chen Hai through them.

99
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:54,839
Also,

100
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,680
what's the update on Hu Dong?

101
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,759
Any new leads?

102
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,439
According to Zhao Jianfeng's statement,

103
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:04,199
Hu Dong had been getting money from him.

104
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:06,160
However, relying solely on his confession,

105
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,920
I don't think it's enough to prove

106
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:09,959
the relationship between Chen Hai and Hu Dong.

107
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:13,319
If Chen Hai's subordinates fall one after another,

108
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,639
he'll definitely get anxious.

109
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,680
He will certainly use Hu Dong to handle a lot of things.

110
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,680
Keep a close watch on Hu Dong,

111
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,800
and we'll definitely find linking evidence.

112
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:23,519
Captain Bai.

113
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,600
The Criminal Investigation team called to say

114
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,120
a female body was found on the outskirts.

115
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,360
The deceased showed signs of drug use

116
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,199
or being forcibly injected with narcotics.

117
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,080
Captain Shen asked us to send someone over to check.

118
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:36,879
Captain Bai.

119
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:38,919
Here's the situation.

120
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,919
Tian Xin has gone missing.

121
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,080
I checked both her store and her home,

122
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,039
but couldn't find her anywhere.

123
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,559
I feel that the last phone call

124
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,519
we had two days ago

125
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:48,320
seemed suspicious.

126
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,759
Go check it out first.

127
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,559
We originally came here to fish,

128
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,720
but from a distance we saw someone

129
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,360
lying face down over there.

130
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,200
We didn't know if they were dead or alive.

131
00:09:11,159 --> 00:09:12,759
When we walked up closer,

132
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,039
it scared the hell out of us.

133
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,440
Yeah, it was horrifying.

134
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,000
So we called the police right away.

135
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:21,240
Li Xiao.

136
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,080
Alright, go on.

137
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,000
Go ahead.

138
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,159
I'm heading in then.

139
00:09:37,399 --> 00:09:37,759
Go on.

140
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:42,679
Don't forget at noon,

141
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,519
to eat at my uncle's place.

142
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:45,799
I'll pick you up when I'm done.

143
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:46,840
No need.

144
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,120
I can go myself after the examination.

145
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,559
Once the autopsy report is out,

146
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,799
notify Captain Lu and me right away.

147
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,360
Where are you going?

148
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:19,759
Hello.

149
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:21,919
Police.

150
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,159
Excuse me,

151
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:23,840
two days ago,

152
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:26,039
did a woman named Tian Xin

153
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,080
have a visit on record?

154
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,200
Tian Xin.

155
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,639
Tian Xin...

156
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,360
One moment.

157
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,159
I found Tian Xin's record.

158
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:36,840
She had three tests done at our hospital.

159
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,360
The last one was a pelvic MRI.

160
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,480
The system shows that

161
00:10:41,879 --> 00:10:44,519
at 11:37 a.m. two days ago,

162
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:46,080
the hospital had issued her report,

163
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,679
and it shows she already picked it up.

164
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,159
11:37?

165
00:10:51,399 --> 00:10:52,679
Yes, 11:37.

166
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,320
All right, thank you.

167
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,519
Please rewind that.

168
00:11:22,519 --> 00:11:22,960
Pause.

169
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,320
Play it in slow motion from here.

170
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:33,759
Stop.

171
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:37,960
Zoom in.

172
00:11:58,519 --> 00:12:00,759
Li Qiang is very adept at counter-surveillance.

173
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,600
He must know exactly where the cameras are.

174
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:06,799
Exactly.

175
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,279
The way I see it,

176
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,600
he got caught on camera on purpose.

177
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:12,720
Li Qiang knew

178
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:16,279
Li Xiao would investigate the places

179
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,559
Tian Xin visited before she vanished.

180
00:12:17,879 --> 00:12:18,679
By doing this,

181
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,320
he's deliberately taunting us.

182
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,919
Before he died,

183
00:12:23,159 --> 00:12:24,639
Xu Duoduo mentioned Tian Xin to Ge Dan.

184
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,240
Looking back now,

185
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:28,120
he was trying to warn us

186
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,919
that Tian Xin was in danger.

187
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,799
Yet we all overlooked it.

188
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:35,639
Where are you going?

189
00:12:36,519 --> 00:12:37,440
Where are you going?

190
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:37,840
To find her.

191
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,080
Get back here!

192
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,279
You have no idea where Li Qiang is right now.

193
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,120
What good is rushing out blindly like this?

194
00:12:43,559 --> 00:12:44,240
Then what should I do?

195
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,759
Just sit here like an idiot?

196
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:47,600
Li Qiang just wants to rattle you,

197
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,799
and it seems he's succeeded.

198
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,879
Li Xiao, don't lose your head!

199
00:12:52,039 --> 00:12:53,000
With so many of us here,

200
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,159
how could none of us realize

201
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:55,320
Li Qiang would go after Tian Xin?

202
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,960
All we do is work cases

203
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,120
and make arrests.

204
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,480
But when it really matters,

205
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,399
we can't even protect

206
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,320
the people closest to us!

207
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:02,600
What kind of cops are we?

208
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,399
What kind of cops are we?

209
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,919
What kind of cops are we?!

210
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,399
Out of my way!

211
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:12,399
Let him go.

212
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,039
Stop right there.

213
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,440
Leave your gun behind.

214
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:28,600
You've lost.

215
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,279
Psychologically,

216
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,879
you've already lost to Li Qiang.

217
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:49,039
He wouldn't really go look for Li Qiang, would he?

218
00:13:53,559 --> 00:13:54,159
No, he wouldn't.

219
00:14:56,279 --> 00:14:57,039
Done venting?

220
00:14:59,759 --> 00:15:00,399
Calmed down?

221
00:15:09,799 --> 00:15:10,919
Just like you,

222
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:15,360
we know the only way to save Tian Xin right now

223
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,679
is to catch Li Qiang.

224
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:19,480
And I believe

225
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:23,200
Tian Xin is pinning all her hopes

226
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,759
on you right now.

227
00:15:27,919 --> 00:15:29,120
If you don't want to let her down,

228
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,000
take a shower,

229
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,720
clean yourself up,

230
00:15:32,039 --> 00:15:33,200
and come back to the team for the briefing.

231
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,480
You reek of sweat.

232
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,559
As long as Xiaokang is around,

233
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:03,000
our deal won't go through.

234
00:16:07,279 --> 00:16:08,879
I want you to make your move tonight.

235
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,080
What's wrong?

236
00:16:23,879 --> 00:16:24,919
You've been on edge these past two days.

237
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,759
Nothing. Just a little tired.

238
00:16:29,159 --> 00:16:30,759
You haven't left my place in two days,

239
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,039
lying in bed the whole time.

240
00:16:32,679 --> 00:16:33,720
How could that wear you out?

241
00:16:34,399 --> 00:16:34,960
By the way,

242
00:16:35,799 --> 00:16:37,240
you've skipped work for two days.

243
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,679
Won't your boss say something?

244
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,200
What if he docks your pay?

245
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,679
Can we not talk about money?

246
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,320
I'll be lucky just to stay alive right now.

247
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,559
What on earth did you do?

248
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:52,360
Didn't you say you worked at Black Panther Club?

249
00:16:53,919 --> 00:16:56,480
Have you been lying to me this whole time?

250
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,919
What am I doing?

251
00:17:00,519 --> 00:17:01,919
Do you even care what I'm doing?

252
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:04,839
Would working at Black Panther Club

253
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,640
deck you out in gold and silver,

254
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,960
and get you this LV bag?

255
00:17:08,799 --> 00:17:09,400
Do you have any idea?

256
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:11,720
I hang out with drug dealers every day!

257
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,640
To make money, I even stole from the boss!

258
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,680
What more do you want from me?

259
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:16,680
Drug dealers?

260
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,440
The boss?

261
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,640
What did you actually do?

262
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:23,039
A couple days ago, the boss sent me to collect cash,

263
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,440
and we ran straight into the cops.

264
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,640
I ditched the guys and ran.

265
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,200
Right now, the boss is probably

266
00:17:28,759 --> 00:17:30,240
sending men everywhere to hunt me down.

267
00:17:38,839 --> 00:17:39,119
Brother Kai!

268
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,279
Brother Kai!

269
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,440
Spare me! Spare me, please!

270
00:17:41,519 --> 00:17:42,279
Why are you running?

271
00:17:42,599 --> 00:17:43,640
I'm not running, I'm not running!

272
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,599
Brother Biao just misses you a lot.

273
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:46,559
Come back with us.

274
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:48,440
You'll be fine.

275
00:17:52,519 --> 00:17:54,000
Brother Kai, Da Na, Brother Wei...

276
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:54,480
I was wrong.

277
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,640
Please let me go, okay?

278
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,640
If I go back with you,

279
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,039
I'm a dead man.

280
00:17:58,039 --> 00:17:58,480
I messed up.

281
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,799
If we wanted you dead, you'd be dead already.

282
00:18:00,119 --> 00:18:01,240
The boss is furious right now.

283
00:18:01,599 --> 00:18:03,920
Go back right now and explain it to Brother Biao.

284
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,640
Hiding out like this won't solve anything.

285
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:08,000
No, Brother Kai, listen to me...

286
00:18:08,599 --> 00:18:09,160
I—

287
00:18:11,079 --> 00:18:12,079
Brother Wei...

288
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:12,960
Xiao Kang.

289
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:13,759
Shut up.

290
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:15,720
Keep your mouth shut,

291
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:17,960
or I'll kill you.

292
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:34,279
Captain.

293
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:37,200
The autopsy report on the unidentified woman is in.

294
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:38,599
The cause of death

295
00:18:38,599 --> 00:18:40,519
was a forced injection of a massive dose of drugs.

296
00:18:40,759 --> 00:18:42,319
Based on how long the body was submerged

297
00:18:42,559 --> 00:18:44,240
and the biological samples found on her,

298
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:46,200
she likely entered the water at Dongshan Park.

299
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,839
The detectives have already headed over.

300
00:18:49,839 --> 00:18:50,359
Let's go.

301
00:18:52,759 --> 00:18:53,599
Captain Bai, I'm coming too.

302
00:19:02,839 --> 00:19:03,440
There are fish by the river.

303
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,279
You might have to catch one.

304
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:06,039
You got it.

305
00:19:07,559 --> 00:19:08,200
Let's move.

306
00:19:20,799 --> 00:19:21,359
Brother Wei.

307
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,519
Aren't we heading to the club?

308
00:19:27,759 --> 00:19:30,920
Brother Biao said the cops might be watching it.

309
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,160
He told us to meet him somewhere else.

310
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,680
So where are we going?

311
00:19:36,359 --> 00:19:37,720
What's your rush?

312
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:38,880
What?

313
00:19:39,359 --> 00:19:40,279
Miss Brother Biao already?

314
00:19:43,079 --> 00:19:44,599
After the mess collecting the cash last time,

315
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,799
the rest of us

316
00:19:45,799 --> 00:19:48,440
have been walking on eggshells around him.

317
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:50,400
Good for you, though.

318
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,079
Living it up in comfort,

319
00:19:53,279 --> 00:19:54,680
completely forgetting about us.

320
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:57,079
No, no, not at all.

321
00:19:59,279 --> 00:20:00,279
What's wrong with you?

322
00:20:01,319 --> 00:20:02,359
You look terrible.

323
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:33,319
Where is Brother Biao?

324
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:34,680
Brother Biao!

325
00:21:36,359 --> 00:21:36,759
Come on.

326
00:21:39,279 --> 00:21:39,720
Come on.

327
00:21:43,279 --> 00:21:44,079
Brother Biao said

328
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,160
he doesn't want to see you again.

329
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,119
I was wrong.

330
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,279
I was wrong, bro.

331
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:52,559
The cops were right on me that day.

332
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:53,960
I had no choice.

333
00:21:57,119 --> 00:21:57,640
Don't kill me.

334
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:59,160
Don't kill me, I was wrong!

335
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,160
I shouldn't have stolen the money.

336
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,720
I was wrong, I was wrong!

337
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:02,039
Don't kill me! Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

338
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,440
Xiao Kang might not be a mole.

339
00:22:03,759 --> 00:22:04,839
He went to Brother Biao's room

340
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,559
just to get some cash.

341
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,359
Brother Biao was just worried you'd go soft,

342
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,519
so he sent us to help you out.

343
00:22:12,759 --> 00:22:13,640
I'm not a mole!

344
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:14,400
I'm not a mole!

345
00:22:14,559 --> 00:22:15,599
If Brother Biao says you're a mole,

346
00:22:15,759 --> 00:22:16,400
then you're a mole.

347
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,319
I'm not! I'm not!

348
00:22:19,839 --> 00:22:21,599
Still saying you're not a cop?

349
00:22:24,279 --> 00:22:24,680
Goodbye.

350
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:31,400
Let's go.

351
00:22:43,799 --> 00:22:45,640
Brother Kai, gotta hand it to you.

352
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:47,119
That was impressive.

353
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:48,960
Ruthless as hell.

354
00:22:50,079 --> 00:22:51,720
I thought you didn't believe he was an undercover.

355
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:53,319
I didn't want to doubt my own brother.

356
00:22:53,839 --> 00:22:54,960
But if Xiaokang didn't die,

357
00:22:55,119 --> 00:22:56,599
we'd all be in danger.

358
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:57,480
By the way,

359
00:22:58,240 --> 00:22:59,839
Xiaokang's girlfriend saw us today.

360
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,839
Should we take her out as well?

361
00:23:03,319 --> 00:23:05,519
She was only with Xiaokang to scam some cash.

362
00:23:05,519 --> 00:23:06,920
She won't go looking for trouble.

363
00:23:09,599 --> 00:23:10,039
Let's go.

364
00:23:30,079 --> 00:23:30,519
Don't move.

365
00:23:35,319 --> 00:23:35,799
Don't move.

366
00:23:36,119 --> 00:23:36,799
We're here to save you.

367
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:41,960
I told you to make it look like an accident,

368
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,519
not shoot him dead!

369
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:49,599
We didn't plan on shooting him.

370
00:23:50,039 --> 00:23:50,920
But who knew?

371
00:23:51,039 --> 00:23:52,240
He tipped off the police beforehand.

372
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:55,039
Can't you use your head for once?

373
00:23:55,519 --> 00:23:56,920
Use your damn head!

374
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:58,359
Whether it looks accidental really doesn't matter.

375
00:23:58,839 --> 00:23:59,920
The police have no evidence.

376
00:24:00,119 --> 00:24:01,119
They can't touch us.

377
00:24:01,839 --> 00:24:03,319
Besides, Xiaokang owed money

378
00:24:03,319 --> 00:24:04,480
to plenty of loan sharks.

379
00:24:05,039 --> 00:24:07,079
The cops will follow that lead.

380
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,240
Are you sure?

381
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:12,839
Dead men don't talk.

382
00:24:15,319 --> 00:24:17,960
Still, Xiaokang used to work for us,

383
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:19,880
so the police will definitely show up.

384
00:24:20,119 --> 00:24:21,559
When that time comes, it'll depend on

385
00:24:21,599 --> 00:24:23,279
whether we can hold up under questioning.

386
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,559
Get out, both of you.

387
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,480
Can we trust these two?

388
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:39,599
They're trustworthy.

389
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:41,759
They were part of killing Xiaokang.

390
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:43,480
That's not what I mean.

391
00:24:43,759 --> 00:24:44,880
I'm talking about when the cops arrive.

392
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:46,599
What if these cowards rat us out?

393
00:24:46,759 --> 00:24:48,200
Then we have to prepare for the worst.

394
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:50,000
If the police push too hard,

395
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,359
we'll have to go on the run.

396
00:24:51,559 --> 00:24:52,359
Go on the run?

397
00:24:53,359 --> 00:24:55,359
Going on the run is the last thing I want.

398
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:56,359
Do you see all this?

399
00:24:56,359 --> 00:24:58,079
Everything here took half my life to build.

400
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:00,279
And I'm just supposed to give it away?

401
00:25:03,519 --> 00:25:05,000
If you had handled this earlier,

402
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,319
none of this would have happened.

403
00:25:12,559 --> 00:25:13,400
All right, all right, enough.

404
00:25:15,519 --> 00:25:16,640
I can't put all the blame on you.

405
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,119
What did you say just now?

406
00:25:20,279 --> 00:25:20,799
About Xiao...

407
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:23,880
That Xiaokang borrowed a lot from loan sharks.

408
00:25:24,559 --> 00:25:25,000
Right.

409
00:25:25,599 --> 00:25:26,720
Didn't you tell me to check on him?

410
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,279
While Xiaokang was missing these past few days,

411
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,839
lots of loan sharks were looking for him.

412
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:31,920
So I leaked his home address.

413
00:25:32,319 --> 00:25:34,079
When the police find Xiaokang's place,

414
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:36,039
they're sure to find plenty of clues

415
00:25:36,039 --> 00:25:36,799
left behind by debt collectors.

416
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:41,839
Nicely done.

417
00:25:45,359 --> 00:25:45,720
Brother Biao,

418
00:25:47,279 --> 00:25:48,599
I actually think Xiaokang's death

419
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:49,400
isn't the real problem.

420
00:25:50,119 --> 00:25:51,920
What worries me most right now is Li Qiang.

421
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:53,839
He's wanted citywide.

422
00:25:54,039 --> 00:25:55,160
I'm afraid he'll drag us down.

423
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:56,599
I think

424
00:25:57,839 --> 00:25:58,839
we either close the deal early,

425
00:25:59,319 --> 00:26:00,240
or we call it off entirely.

426
00:26:00,839 --> 00:26:02,079
We're only in this for the money.

427
00:26:02,240 --> 00:26:04,279
There's no point taking such a huge risk.

428
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:13,599
You're right.

429
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,079
I'll arrange the deal as soon as possible.

430
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:32,480
You got pretty lucky, kid.

431
00:26:34,519 --> 00:26:34,960
Start talking.

432
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:38,559
I just accidentally fell into the river.

433
00:26:38,839 --> 00:26:39,680
Come on,

434
00:26:42,359 --> 00:26:43,279
is that against the law, too?

435
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:56,680
It was an accident.

436
00:26:58,079 --> 00:26:59,119
An accident?

437
00:27:05,519 --> 00:27:06,640
Then explain to me

438
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,000
what this is all about.

439
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,119
And you still say you're not a cop?

440
00:27:20,759 --> 00:27:21,160
Goodbye.

441
00:27:32,839 --> 00:27:34,720
The facts are right in front of you,

442
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:37,039
and you're still trying to deny it?

443
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:38,880
Speak.

444
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:47,799
You saw Ah Kai pull the trigger with your own eyes?

445
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:49,039
That's right, Boss.

446
00:27:49,559 --> 00:27:50,799
Right in front of me.

447
00:27:51,039 --> 00:27:52,160
Without batting an eye.

448
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:53,880
Truly ruthless.

449
00:27:59,319 --> 00:28:00,920
Looks like Ah Kai is in the clear, then.

450
00:28:02,759 --> 00:28:03,319
Boss,

451
00:28:04,119 --> 00:28:05,599
are you still suspecting Brother Kai?

452
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,160
I just saw the photos.

453
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,599
Your daughter really looks like you.

454
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:33,839
Especially when she smiles.

455
00:28:35,559 --> 00:28:36,759
I just got back from the provincial department.

456
00:28:37,279 --> 00:28:38,920
I missed your case briefing.

457
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:40,920
How did it go? All right?

458
00:28:42,119 --> 00:28:42,960
It's confirmed.

459
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:45,799
The two bodies are Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

460
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:48,200
I put Li Xiao in charge of this case.

461
00:28:49,519 --> 00:28:50,960
How's Li Xiao holding up?

462
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,079
I suggested to him

463
00:28:53,079 --> 00:28:54,279
that he take some time off,

464
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,480
but he refused.

465
00:28:55,759 --> 00:28:56,920
I think he'll be fine.

466
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:01,160
We shouldn't just be busy cracking cases.

467
00:29:01,279 --> 00:29:03,799
We still need to look after our fellow officers.

468
00:29:04,519 --> 00:29:05,039
Understood.

469
00:29:07,519 --> 00:29:08,720
Ge Dan sent word.

470
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:10,839
Zhuang Yan has entered Cyrano Prison,

471
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:12,920
but apparently took massive risks.

472
00:29:13,599 --> 00:29:14,799
I'm really worried about him.

473
00:29:19,759 --> 00:29:22,400
Zhuang Yan is very adaptable.

474
00:29:22,519 --> 00:29:24,920
I'm confident he can pull off this mission.

475
00:29:26,039 --> 00:29:27,920
We need to speed up our operations here.

476
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:29,440
By the way,

477
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,319
Jiangyang police just notified us

478
00:29:31,559 --> 00:29:32,599
that an eyewitness

479
00:29:32,759 --> 00:29:34,400
spotted Cheng Weimin a few days ago.

480
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,240
If we can capture him quickly,

481
00:29:36,319 --> 00:29:38,440
we can unmask Chen Hai in no time.

482
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:42,880
As the drug supplier,

483
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:45,279
he must have close ties to Zhongtian Logistics.

484
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:46,960
Once he is captured,

485
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:48,839
our investigation into Zhongtian Logistics

486
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:50,200
can take a major step forward.

487
00:29:51,519 --> 00:29:52,160
Then let's get right on it.

488
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:52,720
All right.

489
00:30:04,839 --> 00:30:06,160
The biggest guy over there

490
00:30:06,359 --> 00:30:07,039
is named Kano.

491
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:09,839
He's a notorious thug in Cyrano.

492
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:12,480
He's rotten to the core.

493
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:13,599
I even heard

494
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:16,000
he always picks on guys named Ma here.

495
00:30:25,519 --> 00:30:27,359
You could've escaped right away that day.

496
00:30:27,799 --> 00:30:29,000
Why did you come back?

497
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:32,200
The robbery was moved up.

498
00:30:34,559 --> 00:30:35,839
I didn't want you in danger.

499
00:30:38,319 --> 00:30:38,799
Thanks.

500
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,119
Forget it.

501
00:30:42,759 --> 00:30:45,519
I just didn't want my partner dying early.

502
00:30:49,400 --> 00:30:50,880
Chinese pig, bring the ball over!

503
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:57,440
Have you ever heard the saying...

504
00:30:58,319 --> 00:31:00,759
"The enemy of my enemy is a friend"?

505
00:31:36,279 --> 00:31:36,880
Alright.

506
00:31:53,079 --> 00:31:55,160
Wait, wait, wait!

507
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,559
They're just messing around!

508
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:59,400
That Chinese guy is my friend.

509
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,480
The Chinese guy and the big guy are friends.

510
00:32:02,039 --> 00:32:02,759
No, no, no.

511
00:32:03,079 --> 00:32:03,680
Officer, officer, officer!

512
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,640
I'll give you money.

513
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:06,960
I'll pay you!

514
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:09,079
Go easy on that Chinese guy, okay?

515
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:09,640
Sure.

516
00:32:16,359 --> 00:32:17,440
Put him in solitary.

517
00:32:17,519 --> 00:32:18,039
Take him away.

518
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:44,759
The market price for No. 4 is a bit low.

519
00:33:45,319 --> 00:33:47,039
It's only up two points this month.

520
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:49,400
Add in Psychedelic Blues,

521
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,240
and our profit

522
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:53,559
could actually grow by another five percent.

523
00:33:58,839 --> 00:33:59,920
Here in Jiechan State,

524
00:34:00,119 --> 00:34:02,519
we've been cracked down on by various militaries multiple times.

525
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,599
Now everyone else is rising up.

526
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:08,519
The Andes, known as the Silver Triangle,

527
00:34:08,599 --> 00:34:09,599
and the Amazon region...

528
00:34:10,199 --> 00:34:11,480
Their share of the global market

529
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:13,480
is about to overtake Jiechan State.

530
00:34:14,599 --> 00:34:15,880
We can't just look at the short term.

531
00:34:16,239 --> 00:34:18,199
We must increase the purity of our product,

532
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:19,880
especially No. 4.

533
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,840
In the global market,

534
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:23,239
we have to secure the top spot.

535
00:34:30,559 --> 00:34:31,039
Boss.

536
00:34:33,039 --> 00:34:34,519
Cloud Leopard brought Dr. Du Guangming in.

537
00:34:41,519 --> 00:34:42,559
Let go of me! You...

538
00:34:42,800 --> 00:34:43,960
What do you want?!

539
00:34:45,119 --> 00:34:46,199
What are you doing?!

540
00:34:47,039 --> 00:34:47,440
Let—

541
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:49,280
Who are you people?

542
00:34:58,880 --> 00:34:59,719
What is this place?

543
00:35:00,519 --> 00:35:01,440
Who the hell are you?!

544
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:02,880
What do you want?!

545
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:03,960
No rush to speak.

546
00:35:04,519 --> 00:35:05,079
Have some water.

547
00:35:10,679 --> 00:35:11,599
Who are you people?

548
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,559
Why did you kidnap me?

549
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:36,400
Boss.

550
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,280
Professor Du.

551
00:35:45,599 --> 00:35:46,840
What do you think you're doing?

552
00:35:47,079 --> 00:35:48,800
I told you to invite Professor Du here.

553
00:35:48,800 --> 00:35:49,800
What is this?

554
00:35:53,679 --> 00:35:55,159
What do you want?

555
00:35:55,159 --> 00:35:56,559
My apologies, Professor Du.

556
00:35:56,559 --> 00:35:57,280
Professor Du,

557
00:35:58,239 --> 00:35:59,039
forgive the rough reception.

558
00:36:10,199 --> 00:36:11,599
I'm just a teacher.

559
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:13,599
What do you want with me?

560
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:17,000
Hardly just a teacher.

561
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:18,119
You're far too modest.

562
00:36:18,679 --> 00:36:20,840
You're a renowned figure.

563
00:36:23,679 --> 00:36:25,559
That journal...

564
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:27,000
The international one, what's it called?

565
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:29,079
Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta.

566
00:36:29,079 --> 00:36:29,920
Right, right, right.

567
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:33,199
Young and accomplished, Professor Du.

568
00:36:33,760 --> 00:36:35,599
You bring honor to all Chinese people.

569
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,119
You didn't bring me here

570
00:36:42,639 --> 00:36:44,199
just to discuss academia, did you?

571
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:50,039
Actually, I really did bring you here to talk science.

572
00:36:50,679 --> 00:36:52,760
We're ready to provide you with a platform

573
00:36:53,039 --> 00:36:55,760
where your talent can shine. What do you think?

574
00:36:58,639 --> 00:37:00,239
You want me to make drugs for you.

575
00:37:00,519 --> 00:37:01,039
Drugs?

576
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,840
That's just a word.

577
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:04,719
In the eyes of scholars like you,

578
00:37:04,719 --> 00:37:08,599
it's nothing more than a chemical compound.

579
00:37:10,719 --> 00:37:11,079
No.

580
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:12,760
You've got it wrong.

581
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,920
I'm just a researcher.

582
00:37:15,079 --> 00:37:16,159
I don't make drugs.

583
00:37:16,679 --> 00:37:18,480
Nobody's asking you to cook drugs.

584
00:37:18,719 --> 00:37:20,760
We have factories and workers.

585
00:37:21,159 --> 00:37:22,239
All you need to do

586
00:37:23,159 --> 00:37:24,320
is refine the formula

587
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:27,159
and supervise the process.

588
00:37:27,519 --> 00:37:28,679
Just like in your lab.

589
00:37:28,679 --> 00:37:30,119
Easy as pie.

590
00:37:31,360 --> 00:37:32,039
No, no, no.

591
00:37:32,760 --> 00:37:33,599
You're mistaken.

592
00:37:34,639 --> 00:37:36,119
I won't do anything illegal.

593
00:37:36,679 --> 00:37:37,280
Illegal?

594
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,519
This is Jiechan State.

595
00:37:41,519 --> 00:37:42,679
Is making drugs illegal here?

596
00:37:44,639 --> 00:37:45,719
All right, all right.

597
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:49,639
What you're asking,

598
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,880
I understand completely.

599
00:37:51,039 --> 00:37:51,519
But...

600
00:37:52,719 --> 00:37:54,480
let me tell you clearly:

601
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,039
No way.

602
00:38:00,039 --> 00:38:02,320
Now, that doesn't make sense to me.

603
00:38:02,559 --> 00:38:03,920
We pay you,

604
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:06,920
and let you do what you love doing.

605
00:38:07,719 --> 00:38:09,400
There's no reason to refuse.

606
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:11,519
You're wrong.

607
00:38:12,519 --> 00:38:14,000
My chemical research

608
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:16,360
is meant to advance human civilization.

609
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:17,719
While what you're asking me to do...

610
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:18,800
that's a crime!

611
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:21,360
That's a desecration of conscience!

612
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:22,800
Desecration?

613
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:26,159
What are drugs, anyway?

614
00:38:27,079 --> 00:38:28,079
What defines a drug?

615
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,880
If the government says it is, it is.

616
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:31,599
If they say it isn't, it isn't.

617
00:38:31,679 --> 00:38:32,400
Heroin...

618
00:38:33,519 --> 00:38:34,719
is it a drug?

619
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:35,800
Who invented it?

620
00:38:36,239 --> 00:38:37,960
Wasn't it chemists like you?

621
00:38:38,599 --> 00:38:39,000
No.

622
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:39,800
No.

623
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:44,800
Chemists...

624
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,840
Chemists studied heroin

625
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,079
to...

626
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:48,960
to...

627
00:38:49,199 --> 00:38:51,199
to test its potential

628
00:38:51,199 --> 00:38:52,639
for medicinal use!

629
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:53,760
Yet...

630
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:57,599
you indulge and peddle narcotics!

631
00:38:57,719 --> 00:38:58,239
That...

632
00:38:58,679 --> 00:38:59,880
That goes against basic humanity!

633
00:39:00,199 --> 00:39:01,639
It goes against humanity!

634
00:39:02,159 --> 00:39:03,199
Humanity? I don't care about that.

635
00:39:03,280 --> 00:39:03,960
I only care about profit.

636
00:39:04,599 --> 00:39:05,480
As long as you work with me,

637
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:06,679
I'll give you

638
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:08,280
more than you could ever imagine.

639
00:39:08,719 --> 00:39:10,920
No, no, no.

640
00:39:11,119 --> 00:39:13,519
I don't care about wealth like that.

641
00:39:14,119 --> 00:39:16,360
I can't help you with this.

642
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:17,639
I really can't help.

643
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:19,480
Besides,

644
00:39:19,920 --> 00:39:21,000
I came to Country M

645
00:39:21,159 --> 00:39:22,559
for an academic exchange.

646
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:24,760
Now that I'm missing,

647
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:27,039
the police are surely searching everywhere for me.

648
00:39:28,360 --> 00:39:29,440
If I die here,

649
00:39:31,199 --> 00:39:33,920
you'll definitely become their target.

650
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,440
So right now,

651
00:39:35,719 --> 00:39:37,039
your best choice is to let me go at once.

652
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:39,679
I swear I won't mention you to anyone.

653
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,280
I mean it.

654
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:44,440
The police are after me?

655
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,119
You know what?

656
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:49,119
The military's been keeping tabs on me too.

657
00:39:49,320 --> 00:39:50,199
But I'm not afraid.

658
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:53,440
This is Jiechan State.

659
00:39:53,639 --> 00:39:54,159
So what?

660
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:55,760
Total anarchy, you understand?

661
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:59,480
There's an old Chinese saying:

662
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:01,079
"A wise man yields to circumstances."

663
00:40:01,679 --> 00:40:02,800
But why do I get the feeling, Professor Du,

664
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:04,360
that you don't quite understand that?

665
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:07,039
Aren't you afraid of dying right here?

666
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:17,920
You can kill me,

667
00:40:18,239 --> 00:40:19,760
or you can choose to let me go.

668
00:40:21,639 --> 00:40:22,159
But...

669
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,280
no matter what,

670
00:40:24,719 --> 00:40:26,679
I won't do anything for you.

671
00:40:29,199 --> 00:40:29,599
Never.

672
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:33,519
Then that's too bad.

673
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:34,599
You can go.

674
00:40:36,159 --> 00:40:36,840
What did you say?

675
00:40:37,159 --> 00:40:37,880
I said...

676
00:40:39,079 --> 00:40:41,400
if you choose not to cooperate with me,

677
00:40:42,679 --> 00:40:43,639
you can go.

678
00:40:44,039 --> 00:40:46,000
You can go.

679
00:41:19,239 --> 00:41:19,840
You...

680
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:22,719
You...

681
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:37,280
Boss.

682
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:41,440
After Mr. Ma met Thirade and Jiang Liye,

683
00:41:41,519 --> 00:41:42,559
he was arrested by the police.

684
00:41:43,119 --> 00:41:43,920
He's in prison now.

685
00:41:44,320 --> 00:41:45,599
A narcotics bust?

686
00:41:46,239 --> 00:41:46,760
No.

687
00:41:47,199 --> 00:41:48,400
It was over a stolen national treasure.

688
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:49,719
A national treasure?

689
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,840
Still, now that the police have already

690
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,480
locked him up,

691
00:41:53,679 --> 00:41:55,000
we won't need to do it ourselves.

692
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:57,800
No.

693
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:00,920
He knows too much about us.

694
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:02,320
Take him out.

695
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:04,320
Understood.

696
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:24,960
You all right?

697
00:42:27,039 --> 00:42:27,760
Cen.

698
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:29,679
Time in the hole...

699
00:42:30,239 --> 00:42:31,400
wasn't easy, was it?

700
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:35,400
How are you holding up?

701
00:42:38,079 --> 00:42:39,079
Does it make any difference?

702
00:42:39,920 --> 00:42:42,239
Out here is just a bigger hole.

703
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:44,679
Fine.

704
00:42:44,679 --> 00:42:46,079
If I'd known you were so tough,

705
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,119
I wouldn't have bothered

706
00:42:48,119 --> 00:42:49,079
getting you out.

707
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:51,800
You could've rotted in there forever

708
00:42:52,039 --> 00:42:52,440
for all I care.

709
00:42:54,360 --> 00:42:55,400
If I stay here,

710
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:58,239
you'll never get out either.

711
00:43:02,559 --> 00:43:03,440
What's your problem?

712
00:43:03,960 --> 00:43:07,440
Aren't Chinese people all about repaying favors?

713
00:43:08,719 --> 00:43:10,360
I got you out,

714
00:43:10,519 --> 00:43:11,840
and not even a "thank you"?

715
00:43:12,559 --> 00:43:13,280
Some brother you are.

716
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:17,519
Thank you.

717
00:43:17,880 --> 00:43:18,400
Happy now?

718
00:43:25,679 --> 00:43:27,840
I just figured, since we're both Chinese,

719
00:43:28,119 --> 00:43:29,400
I'd come say hello.

720
00:43:31,360 --> 00:43:33,000
Chinese, foreigner...

721
00:43:33,599 --> 00:43:34,880
What difference does it make here?

722
00:43:37,679 --> 00:43:39,000
The locals here...

723
00:43:39,639 --> 00:43:41,559
they look down on outsiders like us.

724
00:43:42,880 --> 00:43:45,039
The guy who fought you is named Kano.

725
00:43:45,719 --> 00:43:47,039
He's intensely jealous.

726
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:48,320
Watch your back.

727
00:43:49,480 --> 00:43:50,800
You think he can beat me?

728
00:43:55,039 --> 00:43:55,960
What are you in for?

729
00:43:57,079 --> 00:43:58,039
None of your business.

730
00:44:00,599 --> 00:44:01,920
In a place like this,

731
00:44:02,880 --> 00:44:03,840
without any friends,

732
00:44:04,360 --> 00:44:05,599
staying alive...

733
00:44:06,599 --> 00:44:07,239
is tough.
